    name "Detlef Steuer"
    image "https://files.mastodon.social/accounts/headers/001/294/982/original/89a8d1cb88b4024e.jpeg"
    outbox ""
    summary "<p>born at 324ppm, <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/datascientist&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>datascientist</span></a>, <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/father&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>father</span></a>, <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/statistician&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>statistician</span></a>, <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/bicycle&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>bicycle</span></a> lover,  <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/FOSS&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>FOSS</span></a> believer, <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/R&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>R</span></a> contributor since nearly the beginning. Like <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/chess&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>chess</span></a>, <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/computer&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>computer</span></a>-chess and <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/go&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>go</span></a>.  Did I mention <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/emacs&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>emacs</span></a> and <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/orgmode&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>orgmode</span></a>? And <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/ethics&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>ethics</span></a>, especially <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/dataethics&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>dataethics</span></a>. And some <a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/tags/politics&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>politics</span></a>, too. This is my private page, all views mine and only mine.</p>"
