    icon "https://cdn.fosstodon.org/accounts/avatars/108/197/637/416/268/369/original/779c85574e6acd63.jpg"
    name "Axel Rauschmayer"
    image ""
    outbox "https://fosstodon.org/users/rauschma/outbox"
    summary "<p>Topics: <a href=&amp;#34;https://fosstodon.org/tags/JavaScript&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>JavaScript</span></a> <a href=&amp;#34;https://fosstodon.org/tags/TypeScript&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>TypeScript</span></a> <a href=&amp;#34;https://fosstodon.org/tags/fedi22&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;mention hashtag&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;tag&amp;#34;>#<span>fedi22</span></a></p><p>Other interests:<br />&amp;#8211; Languages: German, English, French, Spanish, Dutch, Mandarin<br />&amp;#8211; Sustainability, degrowth, permaculture, urbanism<br />&amp;#8211; Tiny houses<br />&amp;#8211; Education<br />&amp;#8211; Psychology, getting out of one&amp;#8217;s head, heart-centered living<br />&amp;#8211; Minimalist spirituality: Advaita, Daoism, Buddhism, Christian mysticism, J. Krishnamurti, &amp;#8230;</p><p>I live in Munich. <a href=&amp;#34;http://pronoun.is/he&amp;#34; target=&amp;#34;_blank&amp;#34; rel=&amp;#34;nofollow noopener&amp;#34; translate=&amp;#34;no&amp;#34;><span class=&amp;#34;invisible&amp;#34;>http://</span><span class=&amp;#34;&amp;#34;>pronoun.is/he</span><span class=&amp;#34;invisible&amp;#34;></span></a></p><p>Non-tech:<br />&amp;#8211; :pixelfed: Photos: <span class=&amp;#34;h-card&amp;#34; translate=&amp;#34;no&amp;#34;><a href=&amp;#34;https://pixelfed.de/rauschma&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;u-url mention&amp;#34;>@<span>rauschma</span></a></span><br />&amp;#8211; &amp;#128172; Languages: <span class=&amp;#34;h-card&amp;#34; translate=&amp;#34;no&amp;#34;><a href=&amp;#34;https://mastodon.social/@langtales&amp;#34; class=&amp;#34;u-url mention&amp;#34;>@<span>langtales</span></a></span></p>"
    properties "[[&amp;#34;\ud83d\udcdc Blog (#2ality):&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;<a href=\&amp;#34;https://2ality.com\&amp;#34; target=\&amp;#34;_blank\&amp;#34; rel=\&amp;#34;nofollow noopener me\&amp;#34; translate=\&amp;#34;no\&amp;#34;><span class=\&amp;#34;invisible\&amp;#34;>https://</span><span class=\&amp;#34;\&amp;#34;>2ality.com</span><span class=\&amp;#34;invisible\&amp;#34;></span></a>&amp;#34;], [&amp;#34;\ud83d\udcda Free ebooks:&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;<a href=\&amp;#34;https://exploringjs.com\&amp;#34; target=\&amp;#34;_blank\&amp;#34; rel=\&amp;#34;nofollow noopener me\&amp;#34; translate=\&amp;#34;no\&amp;#34;><span class=\&amp;#34;invisible\&amp;#34;>https://</span><span class=\&amp;#34;\&amp;#34;>exploringjs.com</span><span class=\&amp;#34;invisible\&amp;#34;></span></a>&amp;#34;], [&amp;#34;\ud83d\udce7 Newsletter:&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;<a href=\&amp;#34;https://ECMAScript.News\&amp;#34; target=\&amp;#34;_blank\&amp;#34; rel=\&amp;#34;nofollow noopener me\&amp;#34; translate=\&amp;#34;no\&amp;#34;><span class=\&amp;#34;invisible\&amp;#34;>https://</span><span class=\&amp;#34;\&amp;#34;>ECMAScript.News</span><span class=\&amp;#34;invisible\&amp;#34;></span></a>&amp;#34;], [&amp;#34;\ud83d\udca1 Sustainability:&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;<span class=\&amp;#34;h-card\&amp;#34; translate=\&amp;#34;no\&amp;#34;><a href=\&amp;#34;https://mastodon.green/@light_bulbs\&amp;#34; class=\&amp;#34;u-url mention\&amp;#34;>@<span>light_bulbs@mastodon.green</span></a></span>&amp;#34;]]"
